# Week 02 – Development Workflow

## Objective

Practice collaborative development.

## Tasks

- [ ] Select a small feature.
- [ ] Create feature branch.
- [ ] Write code.
- [ ] Test code.
- [ ] Commit changes.
- [ ] Push branch.
- [ ] Create Pull Request.
- [ ] Review code.
- [ ] Merge Pull Request.

## Deliverable

One completed and merged Pull Request.
